    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d390">

                <pb facs="0502" n="422" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg422"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">President Roosevelt
                        to Emperor of Germany</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Executive Mansion</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-01-10"><hi rendition="#italic">January 10,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I am much gratified at Your Majesty’s purpose to send your yacht <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Hohenzollern</hi> to be present at the christening of
                    your new yacht by my daughter, and I assure you of a hearty welcome for your
                    brother, Admiral Prince Henry, to whom I can personally express my cordial
                    feelings of esteem for Your Majesty and my earnest wishes for the prosperity of
                    the German people.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Theodore
                    Roosevelt</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
